  "implementation": [
    "The scalar-map compiler composes exact selected U64 range -> scalar F64 map -> ordered row sum -> scalar extraction children into an enclosing acyclic map. The same summaries compose through the existing rectangular native map. Source names, ports and benchmark inputs do not participate in selection.",
    "The existing phase reduction proof and checked Cranelift map/fold emitter are shared. Each child uses a fixed private stack frame, current parent SSA words and mapped already-admitted immutable parent views. No per-cell/per-fold general helper, managed row/sum intermediate, result cache, arithmetic reassociation or FMA is introduced.",
    "Complete source setup/body/finish/continuation inventories, definite assignment, escape checks and current lexical ownership remain. Captured matrices must be immutable before the complete parent map or rectangle loan. Both builder/range orders, conditional source operations, constant and bounded dynamic cardinalities retain their original order.",
    "Exact factories, source schemas, positive cardinality envelopes and complete source prices produce pure nonserialized funds once during descriptor construction. Both independent image and verified Object paths rebuild funds from their checked source/calls/final visits. Serialized bounds cannot grant funding; forged source/view/membership metadata is rejected.",
    "The parent admits native work, every skipped child source cost, constructor/output/clone/temporary/node/comparison bounds, physical coexistence and full remaining source replay credit. Bounds/cardinality/arithmetic misses discard every private output and replay the original whole parent, preserving exact semantic errors and inactive branches. Counts outside the native envelope are never truncated.",
    "IR376 and Work145 identify the new graph and full prepayment/replay contract. Both established exact Huffman work equations remain unchanged."
  ],
